<div id="u-credit-00475-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tenno-215" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6704451); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6704451&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608668715" alt="tenno-215" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6704451)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tenno-215" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6704451); return false;">tenno-215</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1607170512 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">05 Dec 2020 12:15</span></p>
</div>
